I removed the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `LLMClient<inference>`, and the linker enforces that grant, so the component can't import `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0` until the graph definition actually grants it. The fetch result was never used, so the output is unchanged. Once the graph grants the interface, the import and the call can be added back.

